      "writtenOn": "2016-09-17T16:06:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I suggest not to use inline here. Let the compiler decide.\n\nI prefer to use inline only in header files, usually for empty / single-line functions that the compiler is almost certainly going to inline (or optimize away).",
